<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>document.documentElement.className+=' js';</script>
<title>Sydney Wide Lawns — Lawn Mowing & Garden Care | Sydney</title>
<meta name="description" content="Sydney Wide Lawns — lawn mowing, whipper snipping, edging, weeding and yard clean-ups across Sydney. Cleaner lawns, healthier spaces. Call 0410 437 088 for a free quote.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Sydney Wide Lawns">
<meta property="og:description" content="Lawn mowing, edging, weeding and yard clean-ups across Sydney. Cleaner lawns, healthier spaces. Call 0410 437 088.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Rubik:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Rubik:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F7FAF3;
  --bg2:#EDF4E6;
  --ink:#17240F;
  --muted:#5A6B52;
  --line:#D8E4CE;
  --accent:#5FB518;
  --accent2:#7ACD2E;
  --dark:#14200C;
  --dark2:#14200C;
  --dink:#F4F8FA;
  --dmut:#9FB2BE;
  --font-display:'Baloo 2',ui-serif,Georgia,serif;
  --font-sans:'Rubik',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,92vw);margin-inline:auto}

html.js .drop{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s ease-out,transform .7s ease-out}
html.js .drop.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html.js .drop{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
  *{animation-duration:.001s !important;transition-duration:.001s !important}
}

.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;background:rgba(16,26,12,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4rem;height:80px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
.brand img{height:48px;width:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:4px}
.brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.28rem;line-height:1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}
.brand-sub{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7ACD2E;font-weight:700}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.35rem;margin-left:auto;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{color:#B9C9AE;text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}
.nav-cta{background:var(--accent);color:#FFFFFF !important;padding:.55rem 1.2rem;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700}
.nav-cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.burger{display:none;margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);border-radius:6px;padding:.4rem .6rem;cursor:pointer}
.burger span{display:block;width:20px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin:4px 0;transition:.3s}
.burger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg)}
@media(max-width:920px){
  .nav-links{position:fixed;inset:80px 0 auto 0;background:rgba(16,26,12,.97);flex-direction:column;padding:1.2rem;gap:1rem;transform:translateY(-140%);transition:transform .35s ease;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}
  .nav-links.open{transform:none}
  .nav-links a{width:100%;text-align:center;padding:.5rem 0}
  .nav-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:.3rem}
  .burger{display:block}
}

.hero{position:relative;min-height:95vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#EAF3E1 0%,#E2EED8 58%,#D8E8CC 100%);overflow:hidden;padding-top:80px}
.hero canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.02) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.03) 38%,rgba(14,22,10,.62) 100%);pointer-events:none}
.hero-shade::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(14,22,10,.90) 0%,rgba(14,22,10,.55) 44%,rgba(14,22,10,.12) 72%,rgba(14,22,10,.03) 100%)}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;padding-block:12.5vh 3.4rem;width:100%}
.hero-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;color:#7ACD2E;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero-kicker::before{content:"";width:36px;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5.8vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.06;color:#F6FAF2;font-weight:700;max-width:22ch;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#7ACD2E}
.hero-sub{margin-top:1.1rem;color:#C4D3B9;font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.5vw,1.09rem);max-width:56ch}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:.9rem;margin-top:1.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.85rem 1.55rem;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;transition:transform .15s ease,filter .15s ease}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:brightness(1.06)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#FFFFFF}
.btn-ghost{border:1.5px solid rgba(244,248,250,.4);color:#F6FAF2}
.hero-strip{margin-top:2.6rem;display:flex;gap:2.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding-top:1.2rem}
.hero-strip p{color:#A9BD9E;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.hero-strip strong{display:block;color:#F6FAF2;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:.2rem;font-weight:600}

section{padding-block:5.4rem}
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:2.4rem}
.sec-head::before{content:"";width:40px;height:3px;background:var(--accent);flex:none;align-self:center;border-radius:2px}
.sec-kicker{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4C9A12;font-weight:700}
.sec-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.7rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.12;margin-top:.35rem;max-width:28ch;color:#17240F;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.sec-sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;margin-top:.85rem}

.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(332px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.svc{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:1.65rem 1.5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
.svc:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(20,40,60,.12)}
.svc::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:44px;height:3px;background:var(--accent);transition:width .3s ease}
.svc:hover::after{width:100%}
.svc-ico{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EAF4E0,#5FB518);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:.95rem}
.svc-ico svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:#173A05;fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.svc h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.12rem;color:#17240F;margin-bottom:.35rem}
.svc p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem}

.band{background:var(--dark);border-block:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
.band .sec-title{color:var(--dink)}
.band .sec-kicker{color:#4C9A12}
.band .sec-sub{color:var(--dmut)}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(332px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.step{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:10px;padding:1.55rem 1.45rem}
.step-n{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.75rem;line-height:1;color:#4C9A12;margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:700}
.step h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.06rem;color:var(--dink);margin-bottom:.3rem}
.step p{color:var(--dmut);font-size:.92rem}

.why-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:2.4rem;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:980px){.why-block{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.why-list{display:grid;gap:1.05rem}
.why-item{display:flex;gap:.95rem;align-items:flex-start}
.why-tick{flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:.2rem}
.why-tick svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:#FFFFFF;fill:none;stroke-width:2.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.why-item h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.08rem;color:#17240F}
.why-item p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:.1rem}
.why-visual{border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFFFFF,#EDF4E6);padding:1.7rem;display:grid;place-items:center}
.why-visual img{width:min(330px,94%);border-radius:8px}
.why-visual p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:1rem;font-size:.88rem;text-align:center}

.tail{background:#EDF4E6;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;margin-top:1.3rem}
.chip{border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:999px;padding:.5rem 1.15rem;font-size:.88rem;color:#17240F;background:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600}
.tail-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:1.2rem}

.close-band{background:var(--dark);border-block:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);text-align:center}
.close-band .sec-head{justify-content:center;text-align:center}
.close-band .sec-head::before{display:none}
.close-band .sec-title{color:var(--dink);max-width:none;margin-inline:auto}
.close-band .sec-kicker{color:#4C9A12}
.close-band .cta-sub{color:var(--dmut);max-width:58ch;margin:1rem auto 0}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:.9rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.9rem}
.cta-lines{margin-top:1.6rem;display:flex;gap:2.2rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cta-lines p{color:var(--dmut);font-size:.95rem}
.cta-lines a{color:var(--dink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.cta-lines a:hover{color:#7ACD2E}

footer{background:#14200C;border-top:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#9DB394;padding-block:4.2rem 2rem}
.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.96fr 1.04fr;gap:2.8rem}
@media(max-width:880px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.foot-brand{display:flex;gap:.9rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1.05rem}
.foot-brand img{height:52px;width:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:4px}
.foot-brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);color:#F2F8EE;font-size:1.24rem;line-height:1;font-weight:700}
.foot-brand-sub{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7ACD2E;font-weight:700}
.foot h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;color:#F2F8EE;font-size:1.06rem;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.foot p,.foot a{font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.85;color:#9DB394;text-decoration:none}
.foot a:hover{color:#F2F8EE}
.foot-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding-top:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.79rem;color:#7A906F}
section#lbq{--lbq-bg:#F7FAF3;--lbq-ink:#17240F;--lbq-muted:#5A6B52;--lbq-panel:#FFFFFF;--lbq-line:#D8E4CE;--lbq-accent:#5FB518}
.gal-head{margin-bottom:2.2rem}
.gal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(352px,1fr));gap:1rem}
.gal{position:relative;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--dark);margin:0}
.gal img{width:100%;height:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .45s ease}
.gal.wide{grid-column:1/-1}
.gal.wide img{aspect-ratio:auto}
.gal:hover img{transform:scale(1.045)}
.gal-cap{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;padding:.85rem 1rem .8rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(8,10,14,.82) 42%);color:#fff;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em}
.gal-note{margin-top:1.35rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
@media(max-width:640px){.gal-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Sydney Wide Lawns home">
      <img src="assets/logo.png" alt="Sydney Wide Lawns logo" height="48">
      <span>
        <span class="brand-name">SYDNEY WIDE</span><br>
        <span class="brand-sub">Lawns</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navlinks">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#recent">Recent work</a>
      <a href="#process">How it works</a>
      <a href="#areas">Get a quote</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Lawn mowing · Garden care · Sydney-wide</p>
    <h1>Cleaner lawns. <em>Healthier spaces.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Lawn mowing, whipper snipping, edging, weeding and yard clean-ups — servicing Sydney-wide. Regular or one-off, front to back.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61410437088">Call 0410 437 088</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong>Servicing Sydney-wide</strong>suburb to suburb</p>
      <p><strong>Regular or one-off</strong>weekly · fortnightly · monthly</p>
      <p><strong>Free quotes</strong>fast and easy</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="swl-scope" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">What we do</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Everything the yard needs.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">From the weekly mow to the full clean-up.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 16h8l2-5h6"/><circle cx="7" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="16" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><path d="M10 11V7h4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Lawn mowing</h3>
        <p>Regular or one-off mows — front, back, nature strip and everything in between, cut clean and even.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16"/><path d="M4 12h16"/><path d="M4 18h16"/><path d="M9 3v18"/><path d="M15 3v18"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Whipper snipping & edging</h3>
        <p>Crisp edges along paths, driveways, fences and garden beds — the detail that makes the difference.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 4c-8 0-14 4-14 10a6 6 0 0 0 6 6c6 0 8-7 8-16z"/><path d="M6 20C9 14 13 10 20 4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Weeding & garden beds</h3>
        <p>Hand weeding and garden bed care so the beds look as sharp as the lawn.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 8h6v12H9z"/><path d="M12 8V5h2"/><path d="M15 5h3"/><path d="M18 3v4"/><path d="M5 12h2M4 9h3M4 15h3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Weed chemical spraying</h3>
        <p>Targeted spraying for weeds in lawns, beds and paved areas — safe and effective.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/><path d="M10 20v-6h4v6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Yard clean-ups</h3>
        <p>Overgrown block? Moving out? One-off clean-ups to get the whole yard back in shape.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="8" width="12" height="8"/><path d="M14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Green waste removal</h3>
        <p>All clippings and green waste taken away — no pile left behind for you to deal with.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="swl-method band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Easy from the first message.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Three steps to a lawn you don't have to think about.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">01</p><h3>Send a message</h3><p>Call or message with your suburb and what the yard needs — photos help.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">02</p><h3>Get a quote</h3><p>A clear price for the job — regular visits or one-off clean-up.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">03</p><h3>We get it done</h3><p>The mow, the edges, the beds, the waste — done right, every visit.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="swl-why" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-block">
      <div class="drop">
        <p class="sec-kicker">Why Sydney Wide</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:.35rem">Lawns that speak for themselves.</h2>
        <div class="why-list" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Sydney-wide</h3><p>From the Shire to the Hills — if you're in Sydney, we can get to you.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>The full job</h3><p>Mowing, snipping, edging, weeding and waste removal — not just a quick cut.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Before & after proof</h3><p>Our transformations do the talking — check the gallery.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Easy to deal with</h3><p>Clear quotes, reliable visits, and a yard that's ready for the weekend.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-visual drop">
        <img src="assets/work.jpg" alt="Sydney Wide Lawns">
        <p>Sydney Wide Lawns — mowing, edging and garden care across Sydney.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="swl-recent" id="recent">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="gal-head drop">
      <p class="sec-kicker">Before & after</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">The transformations.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Real yards, real results — mowed, edged, weeded and cleaned up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gal-grid">
      <figure class="gal drop wide">
        <img src="assets/gal_1.jpg" alt="Before and after of a backyard: overgrown grass transformed into a neatly mowed lawn, Sydney Wide Lawns branding" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Before & after — backyard transformation</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_2.jpg" alt="Three-part before and after collage: backyard, front yard and fence line all cleaned up" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Three yards, one visit</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_3.jpg" alt="Mowed lawn with a cleanly edged concrete path" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Mowed & edged path</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_4.jpg" alt="Tidy lawn and clean edges beside a residential driveway" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Driveway & lawn, tidied</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_5.jpg" alt="Mowed nature strip between a fence and the street kerb" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Nature strip, neat cut</figcaption>
      </figure>
